WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:00.890
<b>Kyushu Saga International Airport</b>

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.750
<i>Previously on </i>Zombie Land Saga Revenge<i>,</i>

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.820
<i>Iron Frill is coming to our town! 
There's a new venue for them to break in now!</i>

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:10.340
<i>That being the case, we ended up as the 
opening for Iron Frill's concert at the Saga Arena!</i>

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.860
<i>But apparently Kotaro-san wants to avoid the 
resemblance to their legendary original center</i>

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:15.000
<i>from being too obvious
 and is keeping Ai-chan off stage!</i>

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.110
<i>After all this time...?</i>

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.140
<i>Ai-chan's been doing solo stuff while 
we've been getting ready for the show,</i>

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.820
<i>with members of Franchouchou operating 
separately for the first time ever!</i>

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.130
<i>We're nervous and panicky, but if nothing 
else, we can't mess up again like we did at the EFS!</i>

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>But then the leader 
of Iron Frill, Shiori-san,</i>

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.380
<i>showed up and tried to recruit Ai-chan?!</i>

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.990
<i>There's absolutely no way 
we can let that happen!</i>

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.440
Number Three of Franchouchou! 
You should join Iron Frill!

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:53.580
It's gonna be okay! Ai-chan wouldn't 
ditch us to join Iron Frill.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:58.230
I mean, she's part of Franchouchou 
and a zombie... She's one of us.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.070
I'm sure you're right.

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:08.810
She'd probably scold me for 
getting nervous like this.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.580
Th-That's right! I bet she'd be so mad!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.180
She'd be all, "Is that really what you 
should be worried about right now?"

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:22.950
Let's keep what we saw a secret.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.910
It's almost time for the 
Saga Arena show, after all.

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.150
Yeah! Let's do our best!

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.270
Even if we have nothing else, 
we still have the future.

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:38.200
A lowest point? Starting over from zero? 
That's just part of the saga.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.940
Even if we burn out in the process, 
we'll make it come true!

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:42.860
This is where our revenge begins!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:48.370
<b>{title}Zombie Land Saga 
Revenge</b>

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:53.670
<b>Pure-Hearted Electric SAGA</b>

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.930
That was sweet, Tae! 
That's the impact we need!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.310
We're gonna blow the doors off Saga Arena!

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.160
Junko?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:22.690
Hey! Junko!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.460
You okay, girl?

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.640
What's wrong? Do we need more impact?

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.990
Maybe you should get some rest.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.620
I'm all right!

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:44.960
Sorry. I think I'll just go get some fresh air.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.480
Going for a walk, huh?

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:57.160
It's so close to showtime,
 but she's been really out of it lately.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.380
Junko-chan's probably got it rough.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:04.020
She's had a scary look on her face ever 
since Ai-chan started doing solo stuff.

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.390
We better hold the fort down for her, then!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:09.680
All right, let's crank this 
impact up as high as possible!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.180
Yeah!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.660
Junko-chan must still be 
worried about Ai-chan...

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.100
What am I gonna do?

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.420
Maybe I could ask Ai-chan...

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:24.420
Not this time! Seriously, 
what am I gonna do?!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.230
Wow, what a feast!

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:34.240
One of the customers from the bar 
brought some ingredients in last night.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:38.340
It's all Junko-chan's favorites, too.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.530
And beef!

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:43.140
This is for Ai-han's lunch.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:47.080
I guess Ai-chan is recording 
solo tonight, too...

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.780
They say you can't wage 
war on an empty stomach,

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:56.150
and without physical strength
the mind tends to shut down.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:59.640
Our smiles are what everything else 
we have is built on, right?

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:04.860
Let me help, too!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.370
Could you set everything out, then?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:10.240
Make sure to put some rice 
in the lunch box, too.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:11.290
Yeah!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.590
Now, where's that rice scoop...

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.660
All right, looking good!

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:18.080
Here we go.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:19.660
I'm passing by underneath!

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:20.290
Right!

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.710
It's totally spotless!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.860
Once everyone's ready, 
we'll go over the set.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:33.170
<i>This is going to be the best show possible.</i>

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.140
<i>To show her how strong we are.</i>

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.530
Shiori, can we talk?

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:41.400
Yui?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:46.330
I heard you were trying to recruit 
a new member on your own...

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.680
From those local Saga idols, 
whatever they're called.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.250
Yes, that's right.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:55.880
She might be working in obscurity out here, 
but her skills are serious.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:59.960
By gaining members with new talent, 
we'll be even stronger.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:05.210
Always evolving to become the strongest.
 That's Iron Frill.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:08.230
You're the one I'm worried about, though.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.340
Me?

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:14.340
That local idol looks just like her, right?

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:16.290
Just like Ai Mizuno-san.

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:22.540
The incomparable legend, 
the eternal center.

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:26.550
A name Iron Frill will never forget.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.450
I'm willing to admit 
she was a really big deal,

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.210
but she's in the past.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:38.350
I'm interested in her 
because of her potential.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.650
There's nothing else to it.

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.670
Okay, girls. Let's run through the set!

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.910
Okay!

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:56.730
Where does Ai-san truly belong?

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.070
Junko?

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:01.650
What're you doing out here?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.880
What about practice?

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:09.570
Excuse me...

00:07:15.270 --> 00:07:16.530
Did something happen?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.650
No... I was just taking a break.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:20.990
It's all right.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.150
Did you get in a fight with the others?

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:25.660
It's really nothing.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:28.400
You have another job 
coming up, right, Ai-san?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.980
Don't worry about us. Just focus on that.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:33.390
Don't try to brush me off. What happened?

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:42.300
Ai-san... did you enjoy being in 
Iron Frill more than Franchouchou?

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.190
What are you talking about?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:48.250
You're only going to worry 
the others at this rate.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.770
You realize what a critical time 
this is for Franchouchou, right?

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:54.140
Do you want a repeat of 
what happened at the EFS?

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:02.420
You... didn't say no, did you?

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:12.690
Ai-chan! Welcome home.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:17.850
Did you see Junko-chan out there? 
Dinner's almost... ready...

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.580
Huh? Did she... not hear me?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.810
Sure, that must be it...

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.820
Ai, you stupid jerk!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.880
Hey, what's all this? What's up, youngster?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.200
You heartbroken? 
Got them unrequited feelings?

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.050
I get that, I do.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:04.000
Love can seriously be a real jerk.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.430
But we just keep falling into it, don't we?

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.550
You need a shoulder to cry 
on through the night?

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:13.340
Oh, wait, you're underage! That's no good!

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.540
A cop can't be seen soliciting—

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.090
<b>YOU SUC</b>

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.980
<b>YOU'LL SUCCEED</b>

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.650
I know, I know.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.300
What are you doing?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.090
Uh, I...

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.600
Is everything ready for the show?

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.910
I think Ai-san might leave the group!

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.110
Iron Frill offered to recruit her...

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.870
They said Franchouchou wasn't 
good enough for her...

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:37.180
I can't imagine Franchouchou 
without Ai-san...

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:40.310
But when I think about how talented she is—

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.990
Franchouchou isn't good enough for Ai?

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:48.430
Don't make this about her.

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:50.520
What about you?

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:54.070
You think it's perfectly fine if a member 
of your group gives up on you and bails?

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:56.480
You think you're not worth more than that?

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.960
Are you willing to accept that yourself?

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:04.350
Because that's what you're saying!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.910
That you don't have any appeal yourself!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:09.320
That you can't stop a friend from leaving!

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.410
You're admitting it and not 
even trying to stop her!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:16.740
Who the hell is going to follow someone 
who's lost sight of their own shine

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:19.580
and doesn't even believe 
they're worth standing by?!

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.720
Smash it.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:30.910
This axe of mine has been fighting 
by my side my whole life.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:34.290
With every roar it lets loose, 
my soul is stirred.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:38.040
As long as it can keep making music,
 I can keep moving forward.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.830
Through all the obstacles 
that stand in the way...

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.880
The logic, the limits,

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.400
turning defeat into victory! 
Turning impossibilities into miracles!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:51.090
And, through it all, I was forged into 
the legendary producer Kotaro Tatsumi!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:59.150
Weren't you really depressed 
just the other day...?

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:04.900
And this axe is inside of your soul, too!

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:06.230
So smash through!

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:09.710
Smash through your unglamorous self! 
Through your excuses for giving up!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.900
All the limitations you've set for yourself! 
If there's something you really want...

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.640
Destroy everything in the way and take it!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:25.010
Zombie or not, as long as you shine brightly,
 people around you will follow!

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:29.550
So smash through, Junko Konno!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.680
Junko-chan?

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:40.020
Junko!

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:44.030
You're late! I don't know if 
Tae-chan can hold on much longer!

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:50.260
It's time to eat.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:04.830
I know what we need to do at Saga Arena.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.530
Time to eat!

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:15.570
Junko-han, have a bit of this.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:16.720
Good stuff!

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:40.270
You were too late.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:52.930
<b>{First Eyecatch sign is the name of a saga delicacy}Zombie Land Saga Revenge</b>

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:57.940
<b>Kawago no
 Okuso Park</b>

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:57.940
<b>Zombie Land Saga Revenge</b>

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:10.770
Kotaro-han's touch with cosmetics 
really is something else.

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:14.030
I wonder what he does different.

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:18.750
We just can't seem to get 
that "alive" feel...

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:20.850
No!

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:23.300
Tae-chan, not yet!

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.320
Tae-chan, stop it!

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.300
That should do it.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.220
Now get out there and smash hard!

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.720
Right!

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:39.860
What do you mean you're 
not going on stage today?!

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.430
It's just the way our plans worked out.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:43.930
I thought you should know.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:47.740
We came here to give the 
best performance possible!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:52.650
But... Franchouchou without you 
is just a group of nobodies!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.530
You really shouldn't 
underestimate Franchouchou.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.910
They've been growing this whole time.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.500
Even I need to be careful if I don't 
want them to leave me behind.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:07.330
Watch their performance. 
I'm sure you'll understand.

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:12.700
I'm looking forward to it, then.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.820
Who's the opening act again?

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:24.790
You know, <i>them</i>. The regional 
idols who bombed at the EFS.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:28.160
Oh, I saw that online! 
Are they gonna be able to manage?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.020
This is their first big show in a while...

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.260
You think they'll be okay?

00:15:33.260 --> 00:15:35.300
And in enemy territory, too...

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:44.840
You were never really worried 
about my identity, were you?

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:25.720
This rocks!

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.960
The death metal girls are back!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:31.690
Smash it!

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:34.040
<i>There's no doubt anymore in my chest</i>

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:34.550
<i>Yes!</i>

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.310
<i>No end in sight</i>

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:35.610
<i>None!</i>

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:36.180
<i>So do it again!</i>

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.480
<i>It's a tall order to survive in this world</i>

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:41.110
<i>You better keep your eyes in 
front or that's game over</i>

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.080
<i>Why! This is my way, even if you fall apart</i>

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.220
<i>Your whole body will wake 
up again, just like this</i>

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:45.640
<i>Ready?</i>

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:46.020
<i>One (One)</i>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:46.660
<i>Two (Two)</i>

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:47.520
<i>Reach those hands out</i>

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:47.830
<i>Ready?</i>

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:48.240
<i>Fran (Fran)</i>

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:48.770
<i>Chou (Chou)</i>

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.310
<i>Now get down until you fall apart again</i>

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:58.260
<i>The feelings roaring from inside (Don't Stop)</i>

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:02.500
<i>Will now ring out, trembling with
soul (We can make it through)</i>

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:07.530
<i>With your dream in front of you</i>

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:05.790
<i>Even if you lose hope, life goes on</i>

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.790
<i>If fate holds you back, here's where you break out</i>

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:11.550
<i>If logic's in the way right now, 
 you need to smash on through!</i>

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:16.090
<i>The things you'll regret not doing (Don't stop)</i>

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:20.340
<i>The feelings you can't seem
to let go of (We are ready)</i>

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:25.010
<i>Until you make them yours</i>

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.350
<i>Emotions going beyond their limits</i>

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:25.400
<i>Even gonna smash through my old self</i>

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:28.330
<i>Take the passion that's surging forth</i>

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:32.350
<i>And let it turn into a roar!</i>

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.210
<i>Yeah! To be brave</i>

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.600
<i>The flame in your heart blazes</i>

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:34.450
<i>Let's take it and hold it high for all to see!</i>

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.720
<i>Yeah! To be brave</i>

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:36.970
<i>The flame in your heart blazes</i>

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.890
<i>Just do it, until the day 
you finally to grab on</i>

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:40.190
<i>Yeah! To be brave</i>

00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:41.400
<i>The flame in your heart blazes</i>

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.150
<i>Let's take it and hold it high for all to see!</i>

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:44.590
<i>Yeah! To be brave</i>

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:45.860
<i>The flame in your heart blazes</i>

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.080
<i>Just do it, survive until 
you manage to grab on!</i>

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.810
Dummy, it doesn't work that way!

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.740
Now that you mention it...

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:47.130
Ai-chan! Junko-chan!

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.020
We're okay.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.530
Because we're zombies.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:59.140
<i>As long as you shine brightly, 
people around you will follow!</i>

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.130
Here we go again!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:40.300
<i>When were my dreams filled 
with that yearning?</i>

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:43.560
<i>Was it all just a story hidden in my heart?</i>

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.190
<i>It's time to start changing for the better!</i>

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:46.780
<i>Dancing these steps that 
are never gonna end!</i>

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.590
<i>And right before you run out of energy</i>

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:50.240
<i>You wanna sketch out the best future you can</i>

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:58.310
<i>But I'm a little scared...</i>

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:00.600
<i>That can't be true, and you know it!</i>

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:03.250
<i>You'll be okay, so just...</i>

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:06.850
<i>Fight, fight, fight, fight, 
fight, fight, fight!</i>

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.460
